{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.LobAnalytic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.LobAnalytic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.KummerDilogHalf","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerLobachevsky","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.ExpDeriv"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.analyticOnNhd_Lob","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.analyticOnNhd_Lob","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/LobAnalytic.lean#L101-L104","doc":"**`Λ` is real-analytic on the whole open interval `(0, π)`** — the\n`AnalyticOnNhd` form the identity-theorem step (step 3) consumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.analyticAt_Lob","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.analyticAt_Lob","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/LobAnalytic.lean#L47-L99","doc":"**`Λ` is real-analytic at every interior dihedral angle `t ∈ (0, π)`.**\nOn `(0, π)`, `Λ t = Im cLiTwoExt(e^{2it}) / 2`, and the right-hand side is\nanalytic as a composition (entire `exp` ∘ real-analytic linear map, then the\nℂ-analytic `cLiTwoExt` on the open `notCut`, then the ℝ-linear `Im`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}